{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virtual pet device in the corner of your screen! Feed and play with your pet while you work or play for dopamine boosts that makes even mundane tasks a little more fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you feed and play with your pets, their stats will improve, allowing them to evolve. Meticulously fill out your encyclopedia or just explore and find your favorites!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of this game include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimizable display, to keep the game out of your way while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of pets to discover and play with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of minigames that scale in difficulty with your pet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Game Speed to suit YOUR work/play balance.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's Hatching!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130/6bd9a55894091dffae0fe18ba3824ca8f10a965f.jpg"},{"name":"Baby No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130/c1bfad19f8a8ffcfa984eda0579328063a02c408.jpg"},{"name":"They Grow Up So Fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130/517c934bb51e7c5a7e2ae0714879ade007fdcddf.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Coworker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130/4c427561b1f6ff610ac20fc35e8a9328f6f8e38e.jpg"},{"name":"Bye Bye Buh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130/8eabb39466a3ca9c45eefcf824bbecb59a71d010.jpg"},{"name":"Firing Up The Buh-Chipper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130/3e61fb0beb545b55252e3865e3a19b5b91d10897.jpg"},{"name":"BuhBuhBlush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3704130